The Odin source files in this directory (curl*.odin) are copies of the libcurl
bindings that ship with Odin (vendor:curl), taken from the Odin repository
(https://github.com/odin-lang/Odin, vendor/curl) and modified for tobrod:

- curl.odin: on Windows, links our own static libcurl build
  (../curl-src/build/lib/Release/libcurl.lib, see setup.ps1) and drops the
  static CRT (/NODEFAULTLIB:libcmt) instead of the dynamic one
- curl_urlapi.odin: curl_url_get returns Ucode (not ^Ucode) and takes
  part as ^cstring
- the other files are unchanged

